{
  "format": "spreadsheet-app",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "Home Maintenance & Service History",
  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "Due now",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "Maintenance summary",
          "source": "# Home maintenance\n\nThe reference date is editable in **Settings** so this example remains reproducible. Change it to review another day. **Due now** tasks need attention; the next 30 days are shown separately.\n\n{% let due = COUNTIF(Equipment[Status], \"Due now\") %}\nThere {% if due = 1 %}is{% else %}are{% end %} **{{ due }}** task{% if due = 1 %}{% else %}s{% end %} due now. Start with the furnace filter, last changed July 2.\n\nTry recording completion for **HVAC-01** in the form below. The service log gains a dated record, and the equipment table recalculates its next due date."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "name": "Equipment",
          "rowCount": 6,
          "colCount": 7,
          "columns": [
            {
              "name": "EquipmentID",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "Equipment",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "Room",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "IntervalDays",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "name": "LastCompleted",
              "type": "formula",
              "formula": "=MAXIFS('Service history'!ServiceLog[Date], 'Service history'!ServiceLog[EquipmentID], [EquipmentID])"
            },
            {
              "name": "NextDue",
              "type": "formula",
              "formula": "=[LastCompleted]+[IntervalDays]"
            },
            {
              "name": "Status",
              "type": "formula",
              "formula": "=IF([NextDue]<=Settings!B1,\"Due now\",IF([NextDue]<=Settings!B1+30,\"Due within 30 days\",\"Scheduled\"))"
            }
          ],
          "cells": [
            {
              "row": 0,
              "col": 0,
              "input": "HVAC-01"
            },
            {
              "row": 0,
              "col": 1,
              "input": "Furnace filter"
            },
            {
              "row": 0,
              "col": 2,
              "input": "Utility closet"
